# A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true (the GitHub windows-runner default)
# would CRLF-mangle the shell scripts ("\r: command not found") and the patch
# context lines (patch -p1 stops matching the LF work-tree files). Pin LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
# patches must ship byte-exact — no text mangling of any kind
*.patch -text
*.jar binary
